cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the posterior table it produces, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "SuperVDJMachine (supervdj): recoverability of TCR V and J genes from CDR3 sequences"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that computes, for each TCR CDR3 amino-acid sequence, a posterior
  distribution over candidate V and J genes under pretrained generative models of
  V(D)J recombination (OLGA) and selection (SONNIA), together with a calibrated
  candidate-set utility whose coverage is measured on held-out data.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-19"
license: MIT
